{"type":"message","id":"ab4824fa","parentId":"617f8763","timestamp":"2026-05-02T17:15:40.023Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Searching Broader Project**\n\nI'm expanding my search parameters. Previous attempts to locate details on the CRM application and development proposal for Anna, Alessandro, and yourself proved unsuccessful. I'm now looking for broader connections to this significant project.\n\n**Broadening Project Scope**\n\nMy recent efforts to pinpoint the CRM application and development proposal for Anna, Alessandro, and yourself have been unproductive. I'm now broadening my search to encompass wider project-related information, hoping for a breakthrough.\n\n**Retrieving Project Data**\n\nMy prior attempts to locate the specific CRM application and development proposal for Anna, Alessandro, and yourself have been unsuccessful. I am now broadening my memory search to encompass wider project-related information, focusing on uncovering any relevant past discussions or documents.\n\n**Recalling Project Details**\n\nMy prior searches for the specific CRM application development proposal for Anna, Alessandro, and yourself have been unsuccessful. I'm now broadening my query to encompass more general terms, hoping to uncover any relevant discussions or documents related to a \"CRM application proposal\" involving our partners.\n\n**Recalling Partner Proposal**\n\nMy prior memory searches for the specific CRM application development proposal for Anna and Alessandro proved unfruitful. I am now broadening my query to encompass \"CRM application proposal partners\" to uncover any relevant past discussions or documents.\n\n**Recalling CRM Project**\n\nMy recent efforts to retrieve details on the CRM application development proposal for Anna, Alessandro, and yourself have been unsuccessful. I'm now casting a wider net, searching for broader discussions related to this significant project.\n\n**Recalling Presentation Content**\